{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058710/extras/8763aa38121745c9e81928c141efbab6.avif?t=1762535304\" width=600 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JumpMap </strong>is an exciting first-person 3D platformer that features a special mechanic: every time you fall, you get put back to where you were before. Explore 20+ carefully designed levels that challenge your skills in precision and timing. Now with Speedrun Mode: race through all levels and track your best times!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your one and only goal is to reach the top of every level. Focus on climbing, navigating through challenges, and honing your abilities to conquer each ascent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058710/extras/80307cfa19951fbda0ec32a8f279c04b.poster.avif?t=1762535304\" width=600 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058710/extras/80307cfa19951fbda0ec32a8f279c04b.webm?t=1762535304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun Mode</strong>: Play through all levels in one go with the clock ticking. Track your time and aim for your best. Race against yourself and friends for the fastest completion! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Best Time Tracking</strong>: Keep track of your progress by measuring how quickly you complete each level and see your personal best times for added challenge and improvement. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Double Jump</strong>: Perfect your skills with the ability to jump again mid-air, mastering even the trickiest platforms and reaching new heights. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller and Steam Deck Support</strong>: Enjoy seamless gameplay whether you're using a controller or playing on the Steam Deck, allowing you to play comfortably on the go or from the comfort of your couch. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Platforming</strong>: Focus solely on your platforming skills with no distractions\u2014no bosses, weapons, or NPCs\u2014just you and the thrill of mastering each climb and jump. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultra low graphics option</strong>: Optimize your gaming experience with a retro graphics setting designed specifically for older computers, ensuring smooth gameplay without compromising on fun. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automatic rewind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need to restart the level if you fall; the automatic rewind feature saves your progress on every platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058710/extras/823596401bb30feb0f72ff05c9236d6a.poster.avif?t=1762535304\" width=600 height=259 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058710/extras/823596401bb30feb0f72ff05c9236d6a.webm?t=1762535304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speedrun Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to complete all levels in one seamless run while the clock ticks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058710/extras/877a2e3e822d827be2a91fa03a279fdb.avif?t=1762535304\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Best Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a challenging race against the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058710/extras/d5fa9da0660d15a36b15c65f26f1b073.avif?t=1762535304\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>20+ levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level in the game is meticulously crafted by hand, ensuring that each platform is thoughtfully designed and strategically placed to provide a challenging and rewarding experience for players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058710/extras/a5e8f613e4c11be76393d325be854888.poster.avif?t=1762535304\" width=600 height=405 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058710/extras/a5e8f613e4c11be76393d325be854888.webm?t=1762535304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Low Stress Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Things you won't find in the game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumpscares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health bar</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p cl